  "prefLabel": "Bfa 303.01 Fees to Be Established at Meeting of Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfa 303.01 Fees to Be Established at Meeting of Board. The board shall establish fees and charges for applying under and participation in its credit enhancement programs from time to time at a meeting of the board.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Bfa 100) #5719, eff 10-13-93",
